                    EfficientNet-B0 to classify lesions as                      
                    malignant vs non-malignant, using                           
                    per-sample loss weighting that                              
                    combines inverse-frequency class                            
                    weights and inverse prevalence                              
                    skin-tone group weights to promote                          
                    fairness. We perform 5-fold stratified                      
                    cross-validation on the binary labels                       
                    and report mean AUROC. Finally we                           
