                    DenseNet-121 backbone on 128×128 lesion                     
                    images with a lightweight binary head                       
                    for malignant vs non-malignant                              
                    classification. We enforce fairness by                      
                    grouping skin tones into light, medium,                     
                    dark, and unknown, and drawing each                         
                    batch with equal samples from each                          
                    group via a custom                                          
                    GroupBalancedBatchSampler. We correct                       
                    class imbalance using a positive‐class                      
                    weight in BCEWithLogitsLoss and apply                       
                    standard augmentations. Model                               
